  "// ─── perena.html ───────────────────────────────────": "",
    "Head of Growth &amp; Creative Director · 2024–2026": "",
    "A DeFi yield protocol on Solana — grown through experience, not just yield.": "",
    "<a href=\"#overview\">Overview</a>": "",
    "<a href=\"#achievements\">Achievements</a>": "",
    "<a href=\"#purple\">Perena Purple</a>": "",
    "<a href=\"#brand\">Brand</a>": "",
    "<a href=\"#design\">Design &amp; Marketing</a>": "",
    "<a href=\"#voices\">Voices</a>": "",
    "<a href=\"#writing\">Writing</a>": "",
    "<a href=\"#credits\">Credits</a>": "",
    "In a market where every protocol competes on yield, the differentiator is experience.": "",
    "My first video trailer for Perena — went viral on X. <a class=\"ed-inline-link\" href=\"https://x.com/perena/status/1861062088883605732?s=20\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View on X ↗</a>": "",
    "Overview": "",
    "Perena is a DeFi yield protocol built on Solana. As a founding team member, I led a creative and design team of three to four while owning growth, brand, product design, and business development. The pivotal shift for me was growing from a pure creative into a business-led growth person — one who identified product gaps through data and turned them into features.": "",
    "My core belief": "",
    "In a market where every protocol competes on yield, the differentiator is experience. I built that case by combining brand, product, and design decisions, turning each marketing campaign into an opportunity to bring delight to our users.": "",
    "Achievements": "",
    "Built and managed Perena Purple, a VIP retention program engaging 20+ depositors at the $100K+ tier with bespoke, private-banking-style communication.": "",
    "Directed one of Solana's most recognised DeFi brand identities — visual system, tone of voice, mascot character world, merch line and all customer-facing content. Created a system that lives beyond me.": "",
    "Drove the protocol to $30M AUM all-time high through experience-led growth; many users cited brand presence as the reason they chose Perena.": "",
    "IP and physical production of the Perenimals and Perena merch, which drew significant attention in and beyond crypto.": "",
    "Produced one of the most-approached booths at Breakpoint 2025, driven by brand recognition built before the event.": "",
    "Product": "",
    "Perena Purple": "",
    "Perena Purple — invitation-only VIP dashboard": "",
    "Perena Purple is the VIP program I conceived and led end-to-end, from PRD through engineering delivery to marketing launch. It was born from a single metric observation:": "",
    "20% of our depositors held 70% of our AUM. Serious users deserved a more serious experience.": "",
    "Purple was built around four improvements:": "",
    "An exclusive communication channel with direct access to founders and fund researchers.": "",
    "Priority product and protocol updates.": "",
    "A personalised dashboard.": "",
    "Macro market signals paired with protocol opinion pieces.": "",
    "The goal was transparency, trust, and tangible value for the people whose capital mattered most to Perena.": "",
    "I personally managed relationships with over 20 depositors at the $100K+ tier through bespoke outreach that converted conversations into committed capital.": "",
    "To scale the operation, I built a VIP status visualiser from our depositor database and automated the content pipeline using a Claude project that transformed each communication brief into six formats for distribution across channels. I defined the communication tone — a senior female fund manager in a one-on-one client relationship — and used an AI model to polish every message in that voice: onboarding, weekly updates, yield-change alerts, and event invitations.": "",
    "The system proved its worth under pressure. During market downturns and Solana-related exploit events, we reached Purple users immediately — clarifying how their funds were or weren't affected before uncertainty turned into withdrawal decisions. Engagement built trust. Trust reduced churn.": "",
    "The long-term vision for Purple is a private banking experience built inside a DeFi protocol.": "",
    "I operated as the translation layer between protocol mechanics and user experience. I attended product standups to catch UX implications early, crafted PRDs to communicate with engineers without overhead, and worked with designers on briefs we executed together — everyone with enough creative ownership and clear constraints to ship fast, considered output.": "",
    "I facilitated the upgrade of the invest page, directing the product designer to transform a plain table of products into consistent cards that could hold investment thesis and product mechanics. I caught experience failures before they shipped: an invest page that needed filtering logic before it could scale; withdrawal copy that defaulted to USD* across all assets rather than adapting per-product. I also personally deployed several frontend features directly.": "",
    "Brand": "",
    "Building an identity from a logo and a flower": "",
    "Given only a logo and a floral concept to start, I built Perena's complete brand identity from the ground up — visual system, tone of voice, mascot character world, merch line, and all customer-facing content. It has since become one of the most well-liked brand identities in the Solana ecosystem.": "",
    "My intention was for people to remember Perena as the place where they feel safe, confident, and delighted to grow their wealth. The brand needed to feel emotional, personal, and categorically different from everything else that is hyper-marketed in the space.": "",
    "Imagine growing your money the way you wait for a flower to bloom.": "",
    "I built Perena's identity at the intersection of two worlds that don't usually meet: the cold, hard mechanics of finance and the warmth of organic nature. Where other protocols use charts and grids, Perena uses wildflower meadows, vault doors hidden in gardens, cherry blossoms surrounding gold bars. Flowers became the core motif — a visual metaphor for yield, patience, and growth.": "",
    "In terms of colour, we wanted the brand to feel light, luxurious, and whimsical — realistic and cinematic to evoke trust, but also surreally beautiful, a glimpse into a wonderfully wealthy future. We almost romanticised finance: it no longer needs to feel cold or scary, but like a function that welcomes abundance and happiness.": "",
    "<strong>Deep Violet</strong> is our primary colour: warm enough to feel emotional, authoritative enough to feel trustworthy, and deliberately distant from the cold blues of corporate fintech.": "",
    "<strong>Gold</strong> is secondary: the quiet signal of value — a ring on a hand, a keyhole on a vault door, an embossed bar. It never dominates.": "",
    "<strong>Gradient iridescence</strong> is our accent: glitter, shimmer, holographic light. It anchors Perena in the digital world without relying on generic web3 tropes.": "",
    "The feeling I wanted to create: arriving somewhere beautiful. That your money is held somewhere considered, even lavish, but never ostentatious. A private garden with a locked door — and you have the key.": "",
    "Design &amp; Marketing": "",
    "A creative system that outlasts any one person": "",
    "I built and managed a design and marketing team of four that became the creative powerhouse behind all of Perena's output: marketing and interface design, collaboration campaigns, merch design, and physical production. <a class=\"ed-inline-link\" href=\"https://www.figma.com/design/xgAM5swV2Xg1dJ5zfDTmy9/EXT-Marketing?node-id=20-105\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View the latest assets in Figma ↗</a>": "",
    "We built the infrastructure that made the creative function durable and transferable — brand guidelines, tone-of-voice documentation, Perenimals character rules, Purple communication templates, and a VIP relationship database that treated depositor history as relationship capital. We developed custom Midjourney prompt libraries, a ChatGPT brand context, and a Claude project for content operations. When team members transitioned, the brand didn't drift; the system kept running.": "",
    "We managed partnership marketing across the Solana ecosystem:": "",
    "Perenimals": "",
    "The creative team led the creation of Perenimals — Perena's mascot universe, which grew into something larger than a brand asset. The character world became a community, then an NFT series, then a physical product line that resonated well beyond the crypto crowd.": "",
    "Breakpoint 2025": "",
    "At Solana Breakpoint 2025, Perena ran one of the most-approached booths at the conference. We gifted fresh flowers from a flower cart, sold Perenimals blindboxes, and moved fashionable merch that people lined up for. None of it came from heavy sponsorship spend — it came from a brand people already had a relationship with before they walked up, and a genuine intention to spark joy in everyone we met.": "",
    "Voices": "",
    "What people said": "",
    "Users and peers across the Solana ecosystem returned again and again to one thing: how Perena made them feel. A selection of what they said, in their words.": "",
    "Writing": "",
    "Opinion pieces written by me": "",
    "Credits": "",
    "The people who made it": "",
    "For founding Perena and giving me the opportunity — and the creative latitude — to make bold choices. None of this would have existed without that trust.": "",
    "The most inspirational, multi-talented designer I've had the privilege of working alongside. The culture and creative soul of Perena. I learnt more from this person than I can put into words.": "",
    "Our fairymouse, who owned visual design at Perena and truly made it the wonderland it became.": "",
    "Our marketing intern, who executed every brief with care and brought the work to the world.": "",
    "Perena taught me that the one powerful thing a creative can do for a product is to make design decisions that show up in the numbers — and build systems that make that standard outlast any single person.": "",
