    "Tools I've built<br>with AI.": "",
    "At the intersection of language models and creative work — utilities, automations and experiments I've shipped. In the age of AI, I believe the best creatives are also builders.": "",
    "An in-browser devtool for writing and editing case-study pages — format text, insert blocks, manage media and save directly back to source files without touching code.": "",
    "Drag-and-drop tool for placing, resizing and wiring interactive hotspots on the room illustration — with live overlay video and tooltip previews.": "",
    "Systems &amp; automations<br>built at Perena.": "",
    "Infrastructure that let the team operate without Shina in the room — brand, comms, ops and data, all systematised. Many are cocreated with the team.": "",
    "Claude content project": "",
    "Brand voice, Purple comms, and marketing copy — all runnable by the team without Shina's input.": "",
    "ChatGPT brand context": "",
    "Persistent brand context so any team member could generate on-brand content without a briefing.": "",
    "Midjourney prompt library": "",
    "Curated, tested prompts for Perena's visual identity — moodboards, character work, campaign assets.": "",
    "Brand guidelines + tone of voice": "",
    "Written standards for visual identity, copy tone, and brand application — so the standard held without Shina in the room.": "",
    "Perenimals character system": "",
